OL,5,G2230 Friends
OL,6,     FIt's Thanksgiving, and the gang
OL,7,     Fremembers former terrible
OL,8,     FThanksgiving experiences. Chandler
OL,9,     Ftells Monica that he loves her.
OL,10,G2300 The Heat
OL,11,     FAfter a tough service, the chefs
OL,12,     Flet their hair down with a night
OL,13,     Fout in Barcelona. But with Djordje
OL,14,     Fkeeping his options open, which
OL,15,     Fgirl will be invited back to his
OL,16,     Fapartment?
OL,17,G0000 Spreadsheet
OL,18,     FMeet Lauren. Her life's a bit of a
OL,19,     Fmess. She's a busy lawyer, freshly
OL,20,     Fdivorced and a mother of two
OL,21,     Fslightly insane children. And she
OL,22,     Fneeds to get laid.
